.DS_Store

# Python and editor caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/.cache/
**/__marimo__/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/
**/*.swp
**/*_report.txt
.venv/
.venv-card/
.venv-ast/
.venv*/
venv/

# Local/private working state
.arch2
**/.arch2
.agents
**/.agents
.claude
**/.claude
.codex
**/.codex
.cursor
**/.cursor
.gemini
**/.gemini
AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
CODEX.md
**/CODEX.md
GEMINI.md
**/GEMINI.md
GOAL.md
**/GOAL.md
notes
